        "designed_text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Misha &amp; Puff is designed in New England and handcrafted by a network of highly talented and skilled knitters and artisans around the world. Our shared love of craft and the integrity of our materials are the threads that connect us globally. Together with our partners, we’ve found a way to scale handcrafted knits responsibly and respectfully, honoring the values and vision of our company.</p>"
