        "other_text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>As of 2023, we also work with artisan partners in India and Japan.</p><p>Our partners in India provide organic fabrics, and we work with a handful of small vendors on skilled techniques, like Indian hand block prints and embroidery. Our partners in Japan create the highest quality Japanese denim, blending traditional craftsmanship with modern techniques.</p><p><a href=\"/pages/materials\">Read next</a> &gt; <a href=\"/pages/materials\">Materials</a></p>"
